Licensing for raetha/zepp-wristwand
===================================

This repository uses different licences for different parts. In short: the
shared tooling and helper code are free to reuse for anything, while the
WristWand app itself may be shared and remixed but not sold by anyone other
than the author.

1. Shared code and tooling: MIT (see LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   - watch/lib/      (pure JS helpers: circular statistics, aim maths, sensor
                      rate meter, spike analysis, BLE aggregation, protocol)
   - tools/          (packaging, release, site and emulator scripts)
   - .github/        (CI configuration)
   - repository-level docs and config files (README.md, docs/, package.json, ...)

2. The WristWand app: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt)
   Everything inside watch/ except watch/lib/ - the watch app, side service,
   settings page, icon, screenshots and documentation - and, when it is added,
   everything inside ha/ (the Home Assistant component) is licensed under
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International.
   You may study, share and adapt it for non-commercial purposes, with credit,
   under the same licence. You may not sell it or a derivative of it.

3. Names and logos are not licensed
   The name "WristWand" and its icon are not licensed for reuse under either
   licence. Derivatives must use a different name.

The author (raetha) holds the copyright in all original material and may
distribute WristWand under other terms, including in paid app stores.

Copyright (c) 2026 raetha
